{
  "id": "LAM.1",
  "number": "1",
  "bookId": "LAM",
  "reference": "Lamentations 1",
  "copyright": "PUBLIC DOMAIN except in the United Kingdom, where a Crown Copyright applies to printing the KJV. See http://www.cambridge.org/about-us/who-we-are/queens-printers-patent",
  "verseCount": 22,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "1",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "LAM 1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "1",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LAM 1:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "How doth the city sit solitary,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LAM.1.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LAM.1.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "that was",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "LAM.1.1",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "LAM.1.1"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "full of people!",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LAM.1.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LAM.1.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "how",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "LAM.1.1",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "LAM.1.1"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "is she become as a widow! she",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LAM.1.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LAM.1.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "that was",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "LAM.1.1",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "LAM.1.1"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "great among the nations,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LAM.1.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LAM.1.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "and",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "LAM.1.1",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "LAM.1.1"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "princess among the provinces,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LAM.1.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LAM.1.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "how",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "LAM.1.1",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "LAM.1.1"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "is she become tributary!",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LAM.1.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LAM.1.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LAM 1:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "She weepeth sore in the night, and her tears",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LAM.1.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LAM.1.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "are",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "LAM.1.2",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "LAM.1.2"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "on her cheeks: among all her lovers she hath none to comfort",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LAM.1.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LAM.1.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "her:",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "LAM.1.2",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "LAM.1.2"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "all her friends have dealt treacherously with her, they are become her enemies.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LAM.1.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LAM.1.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LAM 1:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Judah is gone into captivity because of affliction, and because of great servitude: she dwelleth among the heathen, she findeth no rest: all her persecutors overtook her between the straits.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LAM.1.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LAM.1.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LAM.1.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LAM.1.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LAM 1:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The ways of Zion do mourn, because none come to the solemn feasts: all her gates are desolate: her priests sigh, her virgins are afflicted, and she",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LAM.1.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LAM.1.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "LAM.1.4",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "LAM.1.4"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "in bitterness.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LAM.1.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LAM.1.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LAM 1:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Her adversaries are the chief, her enemies prosper; for the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LAM.1.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LAM.1.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "LAM.1.5",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "LAM.1.5"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "hath afflicted her for the multitude of her transgressions: her children are gone into captivity before the enemy.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LAM.1.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LAM.1.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LAM 1:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And from the daughter of Zion all her beauty is departed: her princes are become like harts",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LAM.1.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LAM.1.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "that",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "LAM.1.6",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "LAM.1.6"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "find no pasture, and they are gone without strength before the pursuer.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LAM.1.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LAM.1.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LAM 1:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jerusalem remembered in the days of her affliction and of her miseries all her pleasant things that she had in the days of old, when her people fell into the hand of the enemy, and none did help her: the adversaries saw her,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LAM.1.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LAM.1.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "and",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "LAM.1.7",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "LAM.1.7"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "did mock at her sabbaths.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LAM.1.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LAM.1.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LAM.1.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LAM.1.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LAM 1:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jerusalem hath grievously sinned; therefore she is removed: all that honoured her despise her, because they have seen her nakedness: yea, she sigheth, and turneth backward.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LAM.1.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LAM.1.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LAM.1.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LAM.1.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LAM 1:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Her filthiness",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LAM.1.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LAM.1.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "LAM.1.9",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "LAM.1.9"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "in her skirts; she remembereth not her last end; therefore she came down wonderfully: she had no comforter. O",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LAM.1.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LAM.1.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "LAM.1.9",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "LAM.1.9"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", behold my affliction: for the enemy hath magnified",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LAM.1.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LAM.1.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "himself",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "LAM.1.9",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "LAM.1.9"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ".",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LAM.1.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LAM.1.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LAM 1:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The adversary hath spread out his hand upon all her pleasant things: for she hath seen",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LAM.1.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LAM.1.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "that",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "LAM.1.10",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "LAM.1.10"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "the heathen entered into her sanctuary, whom thou didst command",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LAM.1.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LAM.1.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "that",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "LAM.1.10",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "LAM.1.10"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "they should not enter into thy congregation.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LAM.1.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LAM.1.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LAM.1.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LAM.1.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LAM 1:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "All her people sigh, they seek bread; they have given their pleasant things for meat to relieve the soul: see, O",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LAM.1.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LAM.1.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "LAM.1.11",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "LAM.1.11"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", and consider; for I am become vile.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LAM.1.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LAM.1.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LAM 1:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "¶",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LAM.1.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LAM.1.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Is it",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "LAM.1.12",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "LAM.1.12"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nothing to you, all ye that pass by? behold, and see if there be any sorrow like unto my sorrow, which is done unto me, wherewith the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LAM.1.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LAM.1.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "LAM.1.12",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "LAM.1.12"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "hath afflicted",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LAM.1.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LAM.1.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "me",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "LAM.1.12",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "LAM.1.12"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "in the day of his fierce anger.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LAM.1.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LAM.1.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LAM.1.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LAM.1.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LAM 1:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "From above hath he sent fire into my bones, and it prevaileth against them: he hath spread a net for my feet, he hath turned me back: he hath made me desolate",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LAM.1.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LAM.1.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "and",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "LAM.1.13",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "LAM.1.13"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "faint all the day.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LAM.1.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LAM.1.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LAM 1:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The yoke of my transgressions is bound by his hand: they are wreathed,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LAM.1.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LAM.1.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
