                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "LAM.1.18"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "is righteous; for I have rebelled against his commandment: hear, I pray you, all people, and behold my sorrow: my virgins and my young men are gone into captivity.",
